  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 200 degrees Celsius.",
    "Mix the minced lamb, black pepper, cumin powder, coriander powder, and salt in a bowl.",
    "Add the olive oil, garlic, and onion to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Stir in the natural yoghurt and lemon juice.",
    "Thread the mixture onto skewers.",
    "Place the skewers on a baking tray lined with parchment paper.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes or until the kebabs are cooked through.",
    "Serve hot with a side of rice or salad."
